title: "Battleship: a Bataille Navale game in C11 and GTK 3"
abstract: >-
  A complete Battleship game built on a model-view-controller architecture: a
  dependency-free C11 game engine, a GTK 3 interface, a terminal interface and a
  reproducible benchmark of three computer opponents.
